                                "sense_id": "17a61f44-fda0-3001-97b0-053387f82379",
                                "text": "Psychoanalysis, one of the most sophisticated and comprehensive models ever offered in the fields of cognition (epistemology), affect (emotion system), action and motivation (pragmatics) and æsthetics, may very well be the last creation of “modernism.”"
